            description: Some("Creates a transfer location for an Amazon FSx for OpenZFS file system. DataSync can use this location as a source or destination for transferring data. Before you begin, make sure that you understand how DataSync accesses FSx for OpenZFS file systems.  Request parameters related to SMB aren't supported with the CreateLocationFsxOpenZfs operation"),
